# traditional hello world demo
** chapter: 33 Compiler (compiler.html)
** run: eve hello_world.eve        check only: eve -c hello_world.eve        documentation: eve --doc hello_world.eve
primary aspect hello_world is

  ** every aspect must have a process main
  process main is
    print "Hello World!";
  return;
end hello_world;

** print adds a new line after the message, write does not
